Generated imagery
    assets/generated/plate-aircraft.png was produced with gpt-image-2.
    Generated imagery is used for illustration only. Every labelled technical
    figure is authored by hand in src/data/diagrams.js, because an image model
    will invent components and mislabel axes, and a confidently wrong diagram
    in a teaching product is worse than no diagram.
